---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Industry-Specific Wind & Hybrid Energy Solutions | OnLoop Energy" description="OnLoop Energy engineers site-specific captive wind and hybrid power solutions for Textile Dyeing, Ceramics, Chemical Processing, Food Processing, and Cold Storage industries.">
<div>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Tailored Industry Solutions
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          We don't sell generic energy.<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">We solve industry-specific power problems.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">Every industry has a distinct load curve, operating shift schedule, and per-unit production cost pressure. Explore how we engineer captive wind & hybrid power for your specific sector.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Industry Hub Grid */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">Sectors We Serve</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Solutions by Industry</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">Click your industry sector to see specific load challenges, wind-hybrid solutions, and real financial case studies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-8);">
        
        {/* Industry 1: Textile & Dyeing */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <div class="card__icon" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L3 12.5V21h8.5l8.74-8.76z" />
                <line x1="16" y1="8" x2="2" y2="22" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Textile & Dyeing Mills</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              <strong>Core Challenge:</strong> High 24/7 power demand during continuous dyeing cycles and high grid tariff rates eroding thin fabric margins.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/solutions/textile-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            Explore Textile Solutions →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 2: Ceramics & Tiles */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <div class="card__icon" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2" />
                <path d="M3 9h18" />
                <path d="M9 21V9" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Ceramics & Tiles Manufacturing</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              <strong>Core Challenge:</strong> Non-stop kiln operation requiring continuous power, heavy peak demand penalties, and high night-shift power costs.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/solutions/ceramics-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            Explore Ceramics Solutions →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 3: Chemical & Processing */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <div class="card__icon" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M10 2v7.31L4.75 20.5a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h11.08a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L14 9.31V2" />
                <line x1="8.5" y1="2" x2="15.5" y2="2" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Chemical & Processing Plants</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              <strong>Core Challenge:</strong> Strict uptime requirements, high baseline electrical draw, and environmental carbon reduction compliance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/solutions/chemical-industry" class="btn btn--primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            Explore Chemical Solutions →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 4: Food Processing */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <div class="card__icon" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Food Processing Units</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              <strong>Core Challenge:</strong> Seasonal harvest production spikes, heavy monsoon electricity demand when solar output drops, and strict thermal standards.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/solutions/food-processing" class="btn btn--primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            Explore Food Processing →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Industry 5: Cold Storage */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <div class="card__icon" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18" />
                <path d="M5.3 5.3l13.4 13.4M5.3 18.7L18.7 5.3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Cold Storage & Refrigeration</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              <strong>Core Challenge:</strong> Constant 24/7 refrigeration compressor loads driving high nighttime grid bills that solar power cannot reduce.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/solutions/cold-storage" class="btn btn--primary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            Explore Cold Storage →
          </a>
        </div>

        {/* Portfolio CTA Card */}
        <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--space-8); background: var(--color-bg-light); border: 2px dashed var(--color-primary);">
          <div>
            <h3 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Proven Case Studies</h3>
            <p class="card__text" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
              See real financial ROI metrics, monthly savings numbers, and payback periods from actual installed plants across Gujarat.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--secondary" style="justify-content: center; width: 100%;">
            View Case Studies Portfolio →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CTA Section */}
  <section class="cta-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Ready to see what wind + hybrid can do for your factory?</h2>
        <p class="cta-section__text">Tell us your industry sector and average monthly electricity bill. Our engineering team will run a free, site-specific wind feasibility study tailored to your operating hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Request Free Industry Feasibility Study
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
